1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,333
StudyHub: A calm place for your courses, tasks, timetable and notes.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Start by creating an account.
Your data is private. Nobody else can see it.

3
00:00:15,867 --> 00:00:21,433
Not from the faculty? Leave the code empty.
Everything else works the same for you.

4
00:00:21,567 --> 00:00:26,567
This is your overview.
Your day at a glance: lectures, tasks and upcoming deadlines.

5
00:00:26,667 --> 00:00:35,167
Add your courses.
Open Courses, click add and type the name.

6
00:00:37,533 --> 00:00:43,400
Add the rest the same way.
University courses or anything you study on your own.

7
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:48,300
Your weekly timetable.
Lectures, sections, labs and your own study sessions.

8
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:53,500
Tasks and deadlines.
Each task has a course, a day to do it and a deadline.

9
00:00:53,600 --> 00:01:00,667
You get reminded before the deadline.
1 day, 12 hours and 1 hour before, on your phone and laptop.

10
00:01:00,767 --> 00:01:05,400
The AI assistant.
The first time, it asks for your own free API key.

11
00:01:05,467 --> 00:01:09,567
Get a free key from Groq.
console.groq.com/keys → Create API Key → copy the key starting with gsk_.

12
00:01:09,667 --> 00:01:18,167
Paste it and click Save and test.
The site checks the key and stores it encrypted.

13
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:25,233
Write like you text a friend.
It adds tasks and timetable slots for you.

14
00:01:30,467 --> 00:01:38,567
Done, all added.
With deadlines, and linked to the right course.

15
00:01:38,667 --> 00:01:47,167
Focus timer.
Open a task and press start. Your study time is saved.

16
00:01:50,333 --> 00:01:55,933
Bring your Obsidian notes.
Upload your notes folder or a ZIP of it.

17
00:01:56,067 --> 00:02:00,100
The library.
Folders open and close like in Obsidian.

18
00:02:00,167 --> 00:02:06,867
Notes look clean.
Math, code, callouts, tables and diagrams all render.

19
00:02:06,967 --> 00:02:15,467
Weekly review.
Hours studied, time per course, finished tasks and your streak.

20
00:02:15,733 --> 00:02:19,533
Reminders in your own voice.
Record a clip for each stage and it plays with the reminder.

21
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:23,633
Use Claude with it.
Create a connector, then ask Claude about your tasks and notes.

22
00:02:23,733 --> 00:02:30,467
English or Arabic, on any device.
On your phone: open the link and choose Add to Home screen.

23
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:44,933
Get a free key for the assistant from Groq: open console.groq.com/keys, sign in with Google, click Create API Key, copy the key that starts with gsk_ and paste it in Settings → AI assistant.

24
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:51,933
Happy studying! Website: study-joox-friends.loophole.site · Code: github.com/yousefJooX/studyhub
